      }
    }
  }
}

The following renderer input schema is prompt guidance for the target shape.
Input data schema:
{
  "type": "object",
  "description": "Object whose keys become accordion section headings. Each value must be an object (rendered via sub-renderer), an array (rendered as a list), or a string (rendered as prose). Numbers and booleans are rejected because they produce empty sections.",
  "minProperties": 1,
  "additionalProperties": {
    "oneOf": [
      {
        "type": "object"
      },
      {
        "type": "array"
      },
      {
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  }
}
